WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.393
Colours have feelings.

2
00:00:01.553 --> 00:00:03.457
Colours can make us feel things.

3
00:00:03.617 --> 00:00:06.682
Red, orange and yellow feel warm, like the sun.

4
00:00:06.842 --> 00:00:08.979
Blue and green feel cool, like water.

5
00:00:09.139 --> 00:00:13.782
Colours can feel different to different people, so say how they feel to you.

6
00:00:14.482 --> 00:00:15.272
Tints.

7
00:00:15.432 --> 00:00:17.615
Add white to a colour and it gets lighter.

8
00:00:17.775 --> 00:00:19.818
Purple and white make light purple.

9
00:00:19.978 --> 00:00:21.928
Yellow and white make light yellow.

10
00:00:22.088 --> 00:00:24.364
A colour with white in it is called a tint.

11
00:00:25.064 --> 00:00:25.900
Shades.

12
00:00:26.060 --> 00:00:28.382
Add black to a colour and it gets darker.

13
00:00:28.542 --> 00:00:30.353
Green and black make dark green.

14
00:00:30.513 --> 00:00:32.928
A colour with black in it is called a shade.

15
00:00:33.088 --> 00:00:34.667
Add just a tiny bit of black.

16
00:00:34.827 --> 00:00:36.359
A little goes a long way.

17
00:00:37.059 --> 00:00:38.499
Choose on purpose.

18
00:00:38.659 --> 00:00:42.699
When you know how you want a picture to feel, choose its colours on purpose.

19
00:00:42.859 --> 00:00:44.392
Warm for a hot day.

20
00:00:44.552 --> 00:00:45.992
Cool for a quiet lake.

21
00:00:46.152 --> 00:00:47.777
Pale for something soft.

22
00:00:47.937 --> 00:00:49.191
Dark for the night.
